{"seq":19,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:06:43.406Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"18ac1e4937dea797c0257733d9fddc9bab88ff1cb0b0d974b248d19b758a5fa8","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#north-team","text":"@Ilse Varga The contact is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines. She raised the duplicate arrivals on door 6 for the morning shift. In this channel on Aug 20, 2025, Dana said Thea had flagged it again. That's the export where one trailer showed up as two 06:30 check-ins because the driver checked in at the kiosk and dispatch also added him by hand. The North cheat sheet also lists Thea as QFL's main contact. Dana owns the account, so she's the one to ask about where it stands now.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000130","thread_ts":"1791987000.000129"}}
{"seq":20,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:06:47.366Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"ea979f02f19fb2c2dde6210749cc39c0ede51575ca4b85f8fc439e65761fe918","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I answered Ilse in a thread on her #north-team message: the contact is **Thea Ramaswell**, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines.\n\n- **Where it comes from:** On Aug 20, 2025, Dana posted in #north-team that Thea had flagged the duplicate morning-shift arrivals on door 6 again. One trailer showed up as two 06:30 check-ins because the driver checked in at the kiosk and dispatch also added him by hand. The North cheat sheet, a public team file, also lists Thea as QFL's main contact.\n- **What I left out:** The same Aug 20 message mentioned a seat-count change. Ilse didn't ask for it, so I left it out of the reply.\n- **Current status:** I didn't find anything newer on the door 6 issue, so I suggested Ilse check with Dana, who owns the account. The knowledge brain's search was running in keyword-only mode, so newer notes could have been missed.\n\nI only used material Ilse can see herself: #north-team, which she's a member of, and the public team files."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000131"}}
